@startuml arch-07-layers-and-rules
' Layered architecture view with permitted dependencies (the rules an ArchUnit test would enforce)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #2F5D8A
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #F7FAFD
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
title Layered Architecture - permitted dependencies (green) and observed violations (red)

rectangle "Presentation layer\nview.shopping, view.admin, *.xhtml" as P
rectangle "Remote interface layer\nrest (JAX-RS)" as R
rectangle "Application / service layer\nservice (EJB session facades)" as S
rectangle "Domain layer\nmodel, constraints, exceptions" as D
rectangle "Infrastructure layer\nutil (CDI producers, interceptors), security (JAAS)" as I
database "Persistence\nJPA / JDBC" as DB

P -[#1B7F3B]-> S : allowed
R -[#1B7F3B]-> S : allowed (target)
S -[#1B7F3B]-> D : allowed
S -[#1B7F3B]-> DB : allowed
P -[#1B7F3B]-> D : allowed (read-only view models)
I -[#1B7F3B]-> S : allowed
P ..> I : allowed (annotations)
S ..> I : allowed (annotations)

R -[#B00020,dashed]-> DB : VIOLATION ARCH-02\nEntityManager in endpoints
P -[#B00020,dashed]-> DB : VIOLATION ARCH-02\nEXTENDED PC in admin beans
S -[#B00020,dashed]-> P : VIOLATION ARCH-01\nShoppingCartItem in view.shopping
I -[#B00020,dashed]-> P : VIOLATION ARCH-01\nCredentialsBean in view.shopping

legend right
  |= Rule (ArchUnit layeredArchitecture) |= Status |
  | Presentation may access Service, Domain | kept |
  | Rest may access Service only | broken (ARCH-02) |
  | Service may not access Presentation | broken (ARCH-01) |
  | Infrastructure may not access Presentation | broken (ARCH-01) |
  | No package cycles (slices) | broken |
endlegend
@enduml
